<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 500" width="800" height="500">
  <rect width="800" height="500" fill="#f8fafc" rx="8"/>
  <rect x="10" y="10" width="780" height="480" fill="none" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="2" rx="4" stroke-dasharray="8,4"/>
  <text x="400" y="40" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e293b">SI S5 — Supports Guidés (Câblage)</text>
  <text x="400" y="62" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#94a3b8">Schéma pédagogique — Module Réseaux — Dr. BELACEL Madani</text>
  <rect x="50" y="85" width="700" height="35" rx="6" fill="#1e293b"/><text x="400" y="108" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#fff" font-weight="bold">Supports Guidés — Câblage Structuré SI S5</text>
  <rect x="50" y="140" width="340" height="140" rx="8" fill="#e0e7ff" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="220" y="163" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#3730a3">Paire Torsadée (UTP/STP)</text>
  <text x="65" y="185" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Cat 5e: 100 MHz, 1 Gbps (100 m)</text>
  <text x="65" y="203" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Cat 6: 250 MHz, 10 Gbps (55 m)</text>
  <text x="65" y="221" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Cat 6a: 500 MHz, 10 Gbps (100 m)</text>
  <text x="65" y="239" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Cat 7: 600 MHz, 10 Gbps</text>
  <text x="65" y="257" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Connecteur RJ45 — 8 broches</text>
  <rect x="410" y="140" width="340" height="140" rx="8" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#22c55e" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="580" y="163" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">Fibre Optique</text>
  <text x="425" y="185" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Monomode: cœur 9 µm</text>
  <text x="425" y="203" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">  Laser, longue distance (40km+)</text>
  <text x="425" y="221" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Multimode: cœur 50/62.5 µm</text>
  <text x="425" y="239" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">  LED, courte distance (2km)</text>
  <text x="425" y="257" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#475569">• Connecteurs: SC, LC, ST</text>
  <rect x="50" y="300" width="700" height="100" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="60" y="322" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#475569">Câblage structuré — Norme TIA/EIA-568</text>
  <text x="60" y="342" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">• Schémas de câblage: T568A (broches 1-3 et 2-6) vs T568B (broches 1-2 et 3-6)</text>
  <text x="60" y="360" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">• Câble droit (straight-through): PC ↔ Switch | Câble croisé (crossover): PC ↔ PC</text>
  <text x="60" y="378" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">• Longueur maximale d'un segment: 100 m (incluant 90 m horizontal + 10 m de patch)</text>
  <text x="60" y="396" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">• SI S5 — TP câblage: réaliser un câble RJ45 droit et un croisé, tester avec le certificateur</text>
</svg>